<section class="container py-4">
  <%= image_tag "univpt-colour.svg", alt: "Universidade Politécnica de Tomar",
        width: 200, height: 40, class: "img-fluid mb-4" %>

  <h1 class="h2">Project home</h1>
  <p>Agree on one operation to demonstrate at the end of the sprint.</p>

  <button class="btn btn-outline-primary" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
          data-bs-target="#setup-checks" aria-controls="setup-checks" aria-expanded="false">
    Show setup checks
  </button>

  <div class="collapse" id="setup-checks">
    <ul class="mt-3">
      <li>Review the first issue together.</li>
      <li>Verify that a teammate can run the app and tests.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
